Yes, uh, that I did.

34
00:02:13,060 --> 00:02:13,890
But...

35
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:19,960
My body will not heed my call!

36
00:02:21,820 --> 00:02:24,480
Please, you must consider how large I am.

37
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:27,720
Merely lifting my head
will put me so high up.

38
00:02:28,020 --> 00:02:29,491
That's kind of the point.

39
00:02:29,820 --> 00:02:32,777
You're all grown up and you're
still scared of heights?

40
00:02:32,860 --> 00:02:33,860
Mind your tongue.

41
00:02:33,980 --> 00:02:35,140
I am a samurai.

42
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:37,482
Warriors such as I fear nothing.

43
00:02:38,140 --> 00:02:41,500
Then stop whining and
start flying. I will.

44
00:02:41,720 --> 00:02:42,957
Just give me a moment.

45
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:44,040
I'll do it later.

46
00:02:44,160 --> 00:02:47,217
