you're still going to be a coward?

47
00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:48,577
Just fly already.

48
00:02:48,660 --> 00:02:50,240
Will you stop pushing me?

49
00:02:50,380 --> 00:02:51,537
You are not helping!

50
00:02:51,620 --> 00:02:53,097
We don't have time to argue!

51
00:02:53,180 --> 00:02:54,768
