Not the eyelids! Please!

57
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:11,180
Shut your mouth!

58
00:03:11,420 --> 00:03:14,891
We're taking down Kaido and
we're doing it together, okay?!

59
00:03:30,740 --> 00:03:33,257
Mirror Mountain A

60
00:03:33,340 --> 00:03:40,340
clever

61
