defense I have a job to do

62
00:03:48,660 --> 00:03:50,560
Luffy, we'll defeat you!

63
00:03:55,160 --> 00:03:57,860
I just have to survive till he comes back!

64
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:09,980
Hallowed Glacier Splash!

65
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:39,820
you're a part of one and now you're
challenging me as if you're its hero

66
