98
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,640
How?

99
00:08:35,680 --> 00:08:37,060
Oh, God.

100
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:39,140
I'm so happy.

101
00:08:39,620 --> 00:08:40,640
Thank you.

102
00:08:41,140 --> 00:08:42,740
You saved me.

103
