Jack Calderon!

219
00:16:23,140 --> 00:16:25,940
The mehaw!

220
00:16:39,220 --> 00:16:41,780
The mehaw!

221
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:44,877
Nooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo!

222
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,057
I'm going to kill you!

223
00:16:46,140 --> 00:16:49,260
I'm going to kill you!

224
