235
00:18:22,600 --> 00:18:26,320
I am the man who will become
the land of Wano Shogun.

236
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,917
This feeling? Who's been? Huh?

237
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:48,471
Enjoying yourself Otago ?

238
00:18:53,700 --> 00:18:55,497
Where are you going ?

239
00:18:55,580 --> 00:18:56,520
Otama ?

240
