262
00:20:51,380 --> 00:20:54,480
But I have no doubt, it is a deadly enemy.

263
00:21:04,280 --> 00:21:07,780
Now that I look closer,
you're a dragon, aren't you?

264
00:21:09,480 --> 00:21:10,620
Like my father.

265
00:21:11,480 --> 00:21:14,304
